Z||000000||Haze_Performance||04-19-2000||03:15 AM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Ok......... I was sitting at the train station waiting for my girlfriend and there was a silver 97 WS6 T/A (same color as my 2M4) parked next to me. I was looking at the car for about a hour and I think that the hood scoop would fit a Fiero. I know that it wouldnt be functional (maybe front brake cooling?)I remember seeing a scoop in a magazine for the Ram Air T/A look for a Firebird (not the entire hood just a scoop) . Also the rear wing looks pretty close to the size of the Fiero deck. I started wondering about WS6 T/A conversions after seeing the ZR2 Vette conversion. Anyone ever see a Fiero with a Ram Air Hood or Wing?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 04-19-2000).]||||reg||1
